sequenceDiagram
    actor S as Student
    participant UI as Browser (actions.ts)
    participant D as /api/decode
    participant G as guard.ts
    participant R as llm.ts router
    participant M as Model
    participant V as verify.ts

    S->>UI: Read with Clara (sources S1..S8)
    UI->>D: sources, language, dialect, today
    D->>G: access code, rate limit, size
    G-->>D: allowed
    D->>D: fence text and wrap in <source> tags
    D->>R: DECODE_SYSTEM + sources + DecodeSchema
    loop Cheapest provider first
      R->>M: structured request
      M-->>R: JSON that matches the schema
      R->>V: find each quote in the source it names
      alt at least 85% of quotes found
        V-->>R: accept
      else too few quotes found, or rate limit
        V-->>R: escalate to the next provider
      end
    end
    R-->>D: decode + provider used
    D->>V: mark each quote verified, check weekday vs date
    D-->>UI: facts with verified flags (nothing stored)
    UI->>S: tasks, quotes, unverified items marked with "!"
